s46 is the Sovereign46 CLI control plane for coding-agent harnesses.

Usage:
  s46 [command]

Available Commands:
  airplane    manage local airplane mode
  connect     connect a team and configure a harness
  detach      mock-detach a session to an S46 box
  devices     list and revoke paired devices
  disconnect  remove S46 configuration for a team and harness
  doctor      verify local S46 and harness configuration
  help        Help about any command
  login       authenticate with Sovereign46 using magic-link device auth
  logout      clear local credentials
  mode        view or set operating mode
  resume      mock-resume a session locally
  run         start a direct mocked s46 session
  session     session subcommands
  sessions    list local and remote sessions
  share       mock Pi-style HTML share via secret gist
  status      show active team, lane, harness, and mode
  token       print a bearer token for harness helpers
  update      check for updates using Homebrew-safe instructions
  use         switch the active connected team
  version     print build version information
  whoami      print the authenticated user

Flags:
      --config string   path to s46 config.json
      --dry-run         show planned mutations without writing
  -h, --help            help for s46
      --json            write machine-readable JSON
      --verbose         print extra diagnostics

Use "s46 [command] --help" for more information about a command.
